<figure class="chapter-visual perturbation-transition">
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创示意图：一阶态修正与 occupied–empty 跃迁空间</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original diagram: first-order state correction and occupied-empty transition space</span>
  </figcaption>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 820 400" role="img" aria-labelledby="pt-title pt-desc">
    <title id="pt-title">Reference state coupled to complementary states and occupied-empty transitions</title>
    <desc id="pt-desc">
      A perturbation has a diagonal component that shifts the energy and off-diagonal components that rotate a reference state into the complementary subspace. For independent fermions, density response is built from occupied-to-empty transitions with occupation differences and energy denominators.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="pt-arrow" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L8,4 L0,8 z" class="perturbation-transition__arrowhead" />
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <g transform="translate(38 36)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="255" height="135" rx="12" class="perturbation-transition__box" />
      <text x="127" y="28" text-anchor="middle">single-state perturbation</text>
      <line x1="30" y1="98" x2="225" y2="98" class="perturbation-transition__level" />
      <text x="127" y="122" text-anchor="middle">|n⁰⟩, Eₙ⁰</text>
      <line x1="45" y1="52" x2="210" y2="52" class="perturbation-transition__level perturbation-transition__level--faint" />
      <text x="127" y="45" text-anchor="middle">Qₙ subspace: |m⁰⟩, m≠n</text>
      <line x1="127" y1="91" x2="127" y2="61" marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)" class="perturbation-transition__arrow" />
      <text x="144" y="79">H¹mn / (Eₙ⁰−Eₘ⁰)</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(468 24)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="310" height="164" rx="12" class="perturbation-transition__box perturbation-transition__box--accent" />
      <text x="155" y="28" text-anchor="middle">independent-particle response</text>
      <line x1="45" y1="124" x2="265" y2="124" class="perturbation-transition__level" />
      <line x1="45" y1="94" x2="265" y2="94" class="perturbation-transition__level" />
      <text x="278" y="128">occupied i</text>
      <line x1="45" y1="58" x2="265" y2="58" class="perturbation-transition__level perturbation-transition__level--faint" />
      <line x1="45" y1="42" x2="265" y2="42" class="perturbation-transition__level perturbation-transition__level--faint" />
      <text x="278" y="53">empty j</text>
      <line x1="125" y1="90" x2="125" y2="63" marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)" class="perturbation-transition__arrow" />
      <line x1="195" y1="120" x2="195" y2="47" marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)" class="perturbation-transition__arrow" />
      <text x="155" y="151" text-anchor="middle">(fᵢ−fⱼ) Oᵢⱼ H¹ⱼᵢ /(εᵢ−εⱼ)</text>
    </g>

    <line x1="308" y1="103" x2="447" y2="103" marker-end="url(#pt-arrow)" class="perturbation-transition__arrow" />
    <text x="377" y="88" text-anchor="middle">Slater determinant</text>

    <g transform="translate(45 245)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="112" rx="12" class="perturbation-transition__box" />
      <text x="110" y="30" text-anchor="middle">diagonal matrix element</text>
      <text x="110" y="59" text-anchor="middle">Eₙ¹ = ⟨n⁰|H¹|n⁰⟩</text>
      <text x="110" y="86" text-anchor="middle">energy shift, no state rotation</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(300 245)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="112" rx="12" class="perturbation-transition__box perturbation-transition__box--accent" />
      <text x="110" y="30" text-anchor="middle">off-diagonal matrix element</text>
      <text x="110" y="59" text-anchor="middle">Qₙ|Ψₙ¹⟩</text>
      <text x="110" y="86" text-anchor="middle">changes observables and density</text>
    </g>

    <g transform="translate(555 245)">
      <rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="112" rx="12" class="perturbation-transition__box" />
      <text x="110" y="30" text-anchor="middle">denominator warning</text>
      <text x="110" y="59" text-anchor="middle">εᵢ≈εⱼ → large response</text>
      <text x="110" y="86" text-anchor="middle">degenerate/subspace treatment</text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <dl class="perturbation-transition__fallback">
    <div>
      <dt>能量修正 | Energy correction</dt>
      <dd>参考态内的对角矩阵元给出一阶能量移动。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>态修正 | State correction</dt>
      <dd>非对角矩阵元把参考态旋转到补空间，并通过 observable 的交叉项产生响应。</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>独立粒子响应 | Independent-particle response</dt>
      <dd>Fermion 占据将求和组织为 occupied–empty transitions；有限温度则由 <code>fᵢ−fⱼ</code> 加权。</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>学习目的：</strong>区分对角能量移动、补空间态旋转和多轨道 occupied–empty transition sum。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Learning purpose:</strong> distinguish a diagonal energy shift, rotation into the complementary state space, and the occupied-empty transition sum of an independent-particle system.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>图与语义列表必须指出 numerator、energy denominator、occupation difference 和简并边界。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> the diagram and fallback identify the numerator, energy denominator, occupation difference, and degeneracy boundary.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>能级位置和箭头只表示代数结构，不是具体材料的 band structure、optical selection rule 或 excitation spectrum。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> level positions and arrows depict algebraic structure, not a material band structure, optical selection rule, or excitation spectrum.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

